75714566e077f7dc2d8558699824d0202addf95","position":"1787152754029888001-7554a819-90b7-4707-9f41-c007bcf0f3b7"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787152547428815001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"bd1fc9fd-8364-4eb7-b6c5-0839e58f5155","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"ba48-a88a-92bd-45d0"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nMerged work cites analysis artifacts under docs/experiments/ that were never actually committed. The packaged src/rebar/llm/code_review/criteria_routing.json (landed as bc0bdaf39a, Gerrit change 1891, ticket cranial-goodly-seahog / ba48-a88a-92bd-45d0) cites docs/experiments/calibrate_code_review_thresholds.py in three _comment fields, and cranial-goodly-seahog's closing comments say 'Deliverables copied to docs/experiments/: calibrate_code_review_thresholds.py, code-review-threshold-calibration.md, escaped_bug_analysis.py, escaped-bug-review-gap-analysis.md'. Ticket restoring-shallow-blobfish likewise records 'artifact: docs/experiments/write_parity_oracle_prototype.py' as the empirical basis for the surface-parity design that topaz-blubbery-mice implements. None of these five files exist on origin/main — every citation is dangling, so the provenance trail for the 7-member blocking set and the write-parity oracle design cannot be inspected from the repo. The files exist only as untracked working-tree state in one checkout; this ticket lands them.\n\n## Approach\nCommit the five already-written artifacts verbatim (they are the exact deliverables the closed tickets describe; no code changes, no behavior):\n- docs/experiments/calibrate_code_review_thresholds.py — the code-v3 sidecar calibration harness (analog of calibrate_plan_review_thresholds.py).\n- docs/experiments/code-review-threshold-calibration.md — the calibration report (per-criterion signals table + precision-first proposal) that justified the four blocking flips.\n- docs/experiments/escaped_bug_analysis.py — the escaped-bug correlation harness (43 regression bugs vs prior PASS reviews).\n- docs/experiments/escaped-bug-review-gap-analysis.md — its report (defect-match buckets, criteria-gap findings that seeded reflective-central-sponge, unaroused-undead-ibisbill, cherubic-content-woodpecker, restoring-shallow-blobfish).\n- docs/experiments/write_parity_oracle_prototype.py — the behavioral conformance-oracle prototype whose results are recorded on restoring-shallow-blobfish and which topaz-blubbery-mice productionized.\ndocs/experiments/ is the established home for exactly this kind of investigation artifact (30+ existing peers, e.g. calibrate_plan_review_thresholds.py, derive_code_review_threshold.py). It is outside the make lint sources (src tests scripts) and outside the packaged wheel (packages = src/rebar), so the landing is docs-only and inert at runtime.\n\n## Portability\nStatic documentation/analysis artifacts committed to the repo; nothing executes in CI or at runtime, no CI-provider trigger involved. Fully portable across environments with diverse or no CI.\n\n## Scope\n- docs/experiments/calibrate_code_review_thresholds.py (new)\n- docs/experiments/code-review-threshold-calibration.md (new)\n- docs/experiments/escaped_bug_analysis.py (new)\n- docs/experiments/escaped-bug-review-gap-analysis.md (new)\n- docs/experiments/write_parity_oracle_prototype.py (new)\nNo existing file is modified.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The five files above exist on main with content identical to the deliverables recorded on cranial-goodly-seahog and restoring-shallow-blobfish.\n- [ ] The criteria_routing.json _comment citations of docs/experiments/calibrate_code_review_thresholds.py resolve to a real file on main.\n- [ ] No file outside docs/experiments/ is touched; make lint and make typecheck remain green (the directory is outside their source sets).\n- [ ] The change lands through Gerrit with LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"docs/experiments/calibrate_code_review_thresholds.py","reason":"new: code-v3 calibration harness cited by criteria_routing.json _comments"},{"path":"docs/experiments/code-review-threshold-calibration.md","reason":"new: calibration report justifying the four blocking flips"},{"path":"docs/experiments/escaped_bug_analysis.py","reason":"new: escaped-bug correlation harness"},{"path":"docs/experiments/escaped-bug-review-gap-analysis.md","reason":"new: escaped-bug gap-analysis report"},{"path":"docs/experiments/write_parity_oracle_prototype.py","reason":"new: write-parity conformance-oracle prototype recorded on restoring-shallow-blobfish"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"3b78-0256-bf68-4748","ticket_type":"task","title":"Land the cited code-v3 calibration and parity-oracle artifacts into docs/experiments/","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f578c74c-540a-425f-8534-23fa1cb6ca7f","c53081c8-23dc-4fb4-a14b-44318af7d654","bd1fc9fd-8364-4eb7-b6c5-0839e58f5155","7554a819-90b7-4707-9f41-c007bcf0f3b7"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787152754029888002,"uuid":"1b1b52f6-7541-48b6-981b-bc40e83ff113"}